# D-112 (steps/defects.md): a field path deeper than one field as the whole value of a `return:` --
# `return: m\in\x` -- is one value, read by the general path walk; the single-hop read took `m\in` (a
# Structure field) and failed without a word ("translation failed with no located diagnostic").  Through
# `o: Outer` and through `p: Other` (Outer's fields in the other order, admitted by name, D-105): 5 and 5.
# Success is 7.
Inner:
    size_t: x 5U
end: Inner
Outer:
    Inner: in
    size_t: a 1U
end: Outer
Other:
    size_t: a 10U
    Inner: in
end: Other
fn: rd (Outer: m) size_t
    return: m\in\x
fn: go () size_t
    Outer: o
    Other: p
    size_t: u rd(o)
    size_t: v rd(p)
    return: u + v
size_t: got 0U
got: go()
int: ok 3
if: got = 10U
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
